{"title":"Introduction and Schedule","markdown":{"headingText":"Introduction and Schedule","headingAttr":{"id":"","classes":["unnumbered"],"keyvalue":[]},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n## Introduction\n\nWelcome! On this website, you will be able to find all materials needed for the successful completion of your thesis.\n\nThis website was created by me, your supervisor - Lucija Sorić. It exists to simplify our workflows and offer a centralized platform that is easy to find (it is just one link!) and easy to share (still just one link!).\n\nSome parts of this website are static, and unlikely to undergo major change. For example, contact details will always remain the same.\n\nOther aspects, such as research materials, instructions, meeting summaries, and others, will be updated at the appropriate time. The [Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) section](https://soriclucija.github.io/thesis-info/faq.html) will be updated regularly, as more questions come in. This way, I am trying to ensure all of you can benefit from shared information, even if you were not the one to ask it.\n\nThanks for reading and looking forward to working with you!\n\n## Schedule\n\nBelow you can find the preliminary schedule. Upon changes, this will be updated.\n\nFor the sake of transparency, I have included both your tasks and my tasks in the schedule. If you want to see either one of them by itself, click the buttons below.\n\n:::: {.mb-3 .filter-buttons}\n<button id=\"btn-all\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm\" onclick=\"filterColumns(&#39;all&#39;)\">\n\nShow All\n\n</button>\n\n<button id=\"btn-student\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm\" onclick=\"filterColumns(&#39;student&#39;)\">\n\nStudent Only\n\n</button>\n\n<button id=\"btn-supervisor\" class=\"btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm\" onclick=\"filterColumns(&#39;supervisor&#39;)\">\n\nSupervisor Only\n\n</button>\n\n::: table-responsive\n| Week | Dates | Student | Supervisor |\n|:--:|:--:|:--:|:--:|\n| 1 | 31 Aug – 6 Sep | Topic selection, contact supervisor | Send website, plan meeting |\n| 2 | 7 Sep – 13 Sep | Group meeting 1, write proposal | Prepare research materials |\n| 3 | 14 Sep – 20 Sep | Write proposal | On holiday |\n| 4 | 21 Sep - 27 Sep | Write proposal | Prepare research materials |\n| 5 | 28 Sep - 4 Oct | Send proposal by **October 1 at 18:00** |  |\n| 6 | 5 Oct - 11 Oct | Group meeting 2 | Feedback on proposal |\n| 7 | 12 Oct - 18 Oct | Write intro. + method, collect data |  |\n| 8 | 19 Oct - 25 Oct | Write intro. + method, collect data |  |\n| 9 | 26 Oct - 1 Nov | Write intro. + method, send to supervisor by **November 2 at 10:00**, collect data |  |\n| 10 | 2 Nov - 8 Nov | Plan analyses, collect data, group meeting #3 | Feedback on intro. + method |\n| 11 | 9 Nov - 15 Nov | Send analysis plan to supervisor (optional) | Feedback on plan (optional) |\n| 12 | 16 Nov - 22 Nov | Data analysis |  |\n| 13 | 23 Nov - 29 Nov | Analyses and write results |  |\n| 14 | 30 Nov - 6 Dec | Analyses and write results |  |\n| 15 | 7 Dec - 13 Dec | Hand in results by **December 7 at 21:00** | Feedback on results |\n| 16 | 14 Dec - 20 Dec | Write discussion | Feedback on results |\n| 17 | 21 Dec - 27 Dec | Write discussion |  |\n| 18 | 28 Dec - 3 Jan | Write discussion + abstract | On holiday |\n| 19 | 4 Jan - 10 Jan | Hand in first full version by **January 8 at 21:00** |  |\n| 20 | 11 Jan - 17 Jan | Work on final version | Feedback on 1st version |\n| 21 | 18 Jan - 24 Jan | Work on final version |  |\n| 22 | 25 Jan - 31 Jan | Hand in final version |  |\n\n```{=html}\n<script>\nfunction filterColumns(view) {\n  const tables = document.querySelectorAll('table');\n  const table = tables[tables.length - 1];\n  const rows = table.querySelectorAll('tr');\n\n  rows.forEach(row => {\n    const cells = row.querySelectorAll('th, td');\n    if (cells.length < 4) return;\n    const studentCell = cells[2];\n    const supervisorCell = cells[3];\n\n    if (view === 'all') {\n      studentCell.style.visibility = 'visible';\n      supervisorCell.style.visibility = 'visible';\n    } else if (view === 'student') {\n      studentCell.style.visibility = 'visible';\n      supervisorCell.style.visibility = 'hidden';\n    } else if (view === 'supervisor') {\n      studentCell.style.visibility = 'hidden';\n      supervisorCell.style.visibility = 'visible';\n    }\n  });\n\n  // Toggle \"active\" class on buttons\n  document.querySelectorAll('.filter-buttons .btn').forEach(btn => {\n    btn.classList.remove('active');\n  });\n  document.getElementById('btn-' + view).classList.add('active');\n}\n</script>\n```\n:::\n::::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":false,"echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to"